# Frame cost on the mock scene. "bench" rasterises every tile each frame; "bench_idle" redraws
# an unchanged frame, which is layout plus tile hashing with no rasterising. First in the
# window the GUI is designed for, then on a display four times as large.
frame 30
bench 200
bench_idle 200
size 3840 2160
frame 10
bench 100
bench_idle 100
